# Generate the real file with: npm run env:local
# Both values below are public — Row Level Security enforces access, not
# secrecy of these two variables. The service-role / secret key must NEVER be
# placed in this file, in Vercel, in CI, or in git.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:54321
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here
